{
    "title": "Always You: Period Tracker",
    "description": "Always YOU is a period tracker and ovulation app that allows you to track, predict, and learn about your period. This free period tracker allows you quick and easy access to an accurate menstrual cycle prediction and ovulation calculator. Discover menstrual cycle patterns, access free content for all stages of life, and track your symptoms to better understand your body! \r\n \r\nAlways You features:\r\n \r\n\u2022\tAn easy-to-use period tracker, calendar, and calculator from the #1 selling period care brands in the USA \u2013 Always & Tampax\r\n\u2022\tFree, personalized content (articles, videos, tips, and more) relating to all stages of your life cycle\r\n\u2022\tExclusive wellness tips allow you to start taking immediate actions to build healthier lifestyle habits to reduce your stress and improve your mind/body well-being\r\n\u2022\tQuick and simple symptom, period detail, and bladder event tracker to better understand your body as it transforms over your lifetime \r\n\u2022\tDo good just by using the app! By simply downloading and using Always You, you can spark donations of period products to help end period poverty*\r\n \r\n*For every new Always You registration and for every 100 Donation Points earned between 7/1/2023 \u2013 6/30/2024, Always will donate one period product to Feeding America, up to a maximum donation of 1,000,000 pads. Earn 20 points for logging details related to period/bladder leak events; with a maximum of 200 Donation Points for period events per month, 10 Donation Points per day by completing all Micro steps, and 5 Donation Points for each piece of content consumed.\r\n \r\nAlways You does not share or sell your personal data.\r\n \r\nPlease note: Always You should *not* be used as a contraceptive/birth control.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Always YOU is a period tracker and ovulation app that allows you to track, predict, and learn about your period. This free period tracker allows you quick and easy access to an accurate menstrual cycle prediction and ovulation calculator. Discover menstrual cycle patterns, access free content for all stages of life, and track your symptoms to better understand your body! <br> <br>Always You features:<br> <br>\u2022\tAn easy-to-use period tracker, calendar, and calculator from the #1 selling period care brands in the USA \u2013 Always &amp; Tampax<br>\u2022\tFree, personalized content (articles, videos, tips, and more) relating to all stages of your life cycle<br>\u2022\tExclusive wellness tips allow you to start taking immediate actions to build healthier lifestyle habits to reduce your stress and improve your mind/body well-being<br>\u2022\tQuick and simple symptom, period detail, and bladder event tracker to better understand your body as it transforms over your lifetime <br>\u2022\tDo good just by using the app! By simply downloading and using Always You, you can spark donations of period products to help end period poverty*<br> <br>*For every new Always You registration and for every 100 Donation Points earned between 7/1/2023 \u2013 6/30/2024, Always will donate one period product to Feeding America, up to a maximum donation of 1,000,000 pads. Earn 20 points for logging details related to period/bladder leak events; with a maximum of 200 Donation Points for period events per month, 10 Donation Points per day by completing all Micro steps, and 5 Donation Points for each piece of content consumed.<br> <br>Always You does not share or sell your personal data.<br> <br>Please note: Always You should *not* be used as a contraceptive/birth control.",
